// ValidateTokenExchangeRequest is the entry point pkg/op calls for every
// RFC 8693 token exchange landing on the canonical /oauth/token endpoint
// with grant_type=urn:ietf:params:oauth:grant-type:token-exchange.
//
// Dispatches on the requested audience:
//
//   - https://<cluster>/git/repo/<id>  → repo-access; scope = push|pull;
//     SpiceDB gate is repo#pull|push; subject_token must carry
//     entire:repo-access.
//   - https://<cluster>/admin          → ops-access; scope = admin;
//     SpiceDB gate is platform#admin; subject_token must carry
//     entire:ops-access.
